---
import DownloadButtons from '../components/DownloadButtons.astro'
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Install Oia: macOS &amp; Windows, step by step"
  description="How to install Oia on macOS and Windows: download the right build, pass Gatekeeper / SmartScreen on the unsigned build, and sign in with ChatGPT to start generating."
  ogTitle="Install Oia: macOS &amp; Windows"
  ogDescription="Download the right build, pass Gatekeeper / SmartScreen, sign in with ChatGPT, done in two minutes."
  canonical="https://oia.solutions/install/"
  base="../"
>
<header class="pageHero">
  <p class="kicker">Install help</p>
  <h1>Two minutes, no account.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Plain installers for macOS and Windows. Unsigned (no signing budget yet): expect one extra click on first open.</p>
  <DownloadButtons rowClass="ctaRow" anchorId="download" />
</header>

<main class="pageMain">
  <h2 class="catH">Which build do I need?</h2>
  <div class="instGrid">
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>macOS · Apple Silicon</h3>
      <p>M1 to M4, macOS 13+. Open the .dmg, drag <strong>Oia</strong> to Applications.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>Windows · 64-bit</h3>
      <p>Windows 10/11, per-user, no admin. Projects survive uninstall and upgrade.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>macOS · Intel</h3>
      <p>No packaged build yet. <a href="https://github.com/cuongducle/oia#build-from-source">Build from source</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>iPhone / iPad / Android</h3>
      <p>Desktop only. The website works on anything.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="catH">First open: the security prompts</h2>
  <div class="instGrid">
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>macOS: “can’t be opened”</h3>
      <p><strong>Right-click Oia → Open → Open.</strong> Or System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → <strong>Open Anyway</strong>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>macOS: “is damaged”</h3>
      <p>Quarantine flag, not damage. In Terminal:</p>
      <pre>xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Oia.app</pre>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>Windows: “protected your PC”</h3>
      <p><strong>More info → Run anyway.</strong> No admin needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>Verify the download</h3>
      <p>Each release ships <code>checksums-*.txt</code>: compare with <code>shasum -a 256</code>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="catH">First run</h2>
  <div class="instGrid">
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>1 · Zero setup</h3>
      <p>Opens with a sample project and the mock provider. Edit without login.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>2 · Sign in to generate</h3>
      <p>In <strong>Runtime</strong>, sign in with ChatGPT. No API key needed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="instCard">
      <h3>3 · No auto-update yet</h3>
      <p>New versions from the releases page. Projects survive upgrades.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</Page>
